      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. regarding the data security part—i'm a bit worried about breaches or people accessing my database without permission. what are the actual legal requirements for protecting that info so i don't get in trouble during the audit? like, what does 'keeping data secure' actually mean in practice?",
